cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the accompanying paper and identify the software commit when referring to this formalization."
type: software
title: "The Zygmund and Rey conjectures in Lean"
authors:
  - family-names: Martikainen
    given-names: Henri
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: "Lean 4 formalization of proofs of the Zygmund conjecture and Rey’s exponential integrability conjecture, together with the underlying incomparable maximal estimate and related extensions and sharpness results. Includes independently stated Mathlib-only specifications and instructions for reproducing verification with Lean, Comparator and Nanoda."
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: "The Zygmund conjecture and Rey's exponential integrability conjecture"
